# Airoha XR1710G U-Boot environment is embedded inside the "vendor"
# MTD partition (mtd0) at offset 0x200000. The environment image is
# 0x4000 bytes; the underlying flash sector (erase block) is 0x20000.
#   device     offset     env size   sector size
/dev/mtd0       0x200000    0x4000      0x20000
